00:35:11,402 --> 00:35:14,931
And that's, you know, why I'm passionate to be here and very grateful for

484
00:35:15,431 --> 00:35:18,620
this opportunity here. So, what is advancing mobility?

485
00:35:19,646 --> 00:35:23,336
I like to break it down into 3 general categories for people to understand because

