00:35:23,836 --> 00:35:27,249
it's not just a flying car, it's not flying air taxis, it's not even

487
00:35:27,361 --> 00:35:31,291
the electric vertical takeoff and aircraft that you see on the front pages

488
00:35:31,791 --> 00:35:36,183
and the headlines that you see. Advancing mobility is typically characterized by 3 evolving

489
00:35:36,683 --> 00:35:40,338
technologies, and it could be a mix of those 3 technologies. The first

490
00:35:40,838 --> 00:35:44,221
one is new propulsion systems. The ones that's leading the race right

